<view class="page {{theme}}"><text class="eyebrow">YOUR HOME BAR</text><view class="title">我的酒架</view><view class="subtitle">勾选手边已有的酒和材料，剩下的交给灵感。</view>
  <view class="hero section row"><view><view class="stat">{{count}} <text class="small">样材料</text></view><view class="muted">已经在你的酒架上</view></view><view bindtap="discover"><view class="stat">{{ready}} <text class="small">款配方 ↗</text></view><view class="muted">现在就可以调制</view></view></view>
  <view class="row section"><view class="section-title">我的酒架</view><button class="link" bindtap="edit">＋ 登记材料</button></view><view class="shelf"><view wx:for="{{bottles}}" wx:key="id" class="shelf-bottle" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="edit"><view style="height:210rpx"><bar-art mode="bottle" item="{{item}}" /></view><view class="small">{{item.name}}</view><view class="badge">编辑瓶子 ↗</view></view></view><input placeholder="寻找一种材料" value="{{query}}" bindinput="search" />
  <scroll-view scroll-x class="chips"><text class="chip {{category === 'all' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-value="all" bindtap="category">全部</text><text wx:for="{{categories}}" wx:key="key" class="chip {{category === item.key ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-value="{{item.key}}" bindtap="category">{{item.name}}</text></scroll-view>
  <view class="grid"><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="name" class="stock-tile {{item.owned ? 'owned' : ''}}" data-type="{{item.name}}" bindtap="toggle" role="checkbox" aria-checked="{{item.owned}}"><view class="row"><text>{{item.name}}</text><text class="check">{{item.owned ? '✓' : '＋'}}</text></view><text class="small muted">{{item.owned ? '已在酒架' : '点选加入'}}</text></view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{!items.length}}" class="empty">未找到材料，试试更短的名称。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{unknown.length}}" class="section"><view class="section-title">备份中的其他材料</view><view wx:for="{{unknown}}" wx:key="id" class="panel row"><text>{{item.name}}</text><button class="link" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="removeUnknown">移除</button></view></view>
  <view class="info">库存记录“有没有”，不扣减用量。可选材料不计入缺料；做法中提到的冰块、装饰需要另外准备。</view>
</view>
